¬import il from "../../../../../_shared/variables/imageLinks"


**Single click**:

1. Single-click the file name. *- green ring*

2. The file opens in the editor pane to the right as a **Preview Tab**. The tab title appears in italics and will be replaced if you single-click another file. *- orange rectangle*

    Alternatively, select the file and press `Enter` to open it in Preview Mode.

**Double click**:

1. Double-click the file name. *- green ring*

2. The file opens in the editor pane to the right as a **Persistent Tab** that stays open until you close it. *- orange rectangle*

    Alternatively, select the file and press `Ctrl+Enter` to open it in a persistent tab.

{{::il.Vscode_ExplorerOpenFile_img}}


> **Tip:** If your files keep disappearing when you click another in the **Explorer**, **double-clic instead of single-clicking.


**Right click**:

1. Right-click the file name. *- red ring*

2. The **Context menu** displays.

3. Select **Open to the Side** *- yellow ring*

{{::il.Vscode_OpenFile_Right_img}}


4. The file opens in a split editor next to the current file. *- red rectangle*

{{::il.Vscode_OpenFile_Split_img}}

